#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:380
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_WelcomeForSingleBattle"
msgid ""
"Where the hearts of TRAINERS\n"
"are put to the test.\p"
"I welcome you to the BATTLE PALACE.\p"
"I accept challenges to the SINGLE\n"
"BATTLE HALLS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:387
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_TakeSingleBattleChallenge"
msgid ""
"Do you wish to take\n"
"the SINGLE BATTLE HALL challenge?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:391
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_ExplainSingleBattleChallenge"
msgid ""
"In the BATTLE PALACE, there are\n"
"several auditoriums for SINGLE BATTLES\l"
"that are named SINGLE BATTLE HALLS.\p"
"The SINGLE BATTLES are conducted in\n"
"the usual way, except with one crucial\l"
"rule that must be obeyed.\p"
"TRAINERS are permitted only to switch\n"
"their POKéMON in and out.\p"
"TRAINERS are otherwise forbidden to\n"
"command their POKéMON.\p"
"The POKéMON are to behave according\n"
"to their nature and battle on their own.\p"
"You must put your trust in your\n"
"POKéMON and watch over them.\p"
"If you achieve the honor of beating\n"
"seven TRAINERS in succession,\l"
"we will present you with Battle Points.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"challenge, you must save the game.\p"
"If you don't save before interrupting,\n"
"you will be disqualified.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:414
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_ReturnWhenFortified"
msgid ""
"When you have fortified your heart\n"
"and POKéMON, you must return.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:418
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_WhichChallenge"
msgid ""
"There are two BATTLE HALLS,\n"
"Level 50 and Open Level.\l"
"Which is your choice of a challenge?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:423
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLv50"
msgid ""
"Sigh…\p"
"You do not have the three POKéMON\n"
"required for the challenge.\p"
"To enter, you must provide three\n"
"different kinds of POKéMON.\p"
"These POKéMON must all be of\n"
"Level 50 or lower.\p"
"They also must not be holding\n"
"the same kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:435
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsEnd"
msgid ""
"Come back when you have made\n"
"your preparations.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:439
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen"
msgid ""
"Sigh…\p"
"You do not have the three POKéMON\n"
